cal-officials-complete:p003","text":"　　泰始六年，遷山陰令。山陰，東土大縣，難爲長官，僧祐在縣有稱，琰尤明察，又著能名。其年爵新亭侯。元徽初，遷尚書右丞。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":22,"last_line":22,"raw_start":604,"raw_end":670,"raw_character_offsets":[604,605,611,612,613,614,617,618,619,620,621,622,623,624,625,626,627,628,629,630,631,632,633,634,635,636,637,638,639,640,641,642,643,644,645,646,647,648,649,650,651,652,653,654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669],"revision_id":1501803},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p003:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"僧祐","kind":"person","person_id":"5rm_iwc_x07","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p003:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"琰","kind":"person","person_id":"o6u_fls_sgx","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-053","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004","text":"時有北地傅僧祐、潁川陳珉、高平張祐，並以吏才見知。僧祐事在臧燾傳。珉為吳令，善發姦伏，境內以為神明。祐祖父湛，晉孝武世，以才學為中書侍郎，光祿勳。祐歷臨安、武康、錢塘令，並著能名，宋世言長吏者，以三人為首。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73,"raw_start":6048,"raw_end":6151,"raw_character_offsets":[6048,6049,6050,6051,6052,6053,6054,6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,6061,6062,6063,6064,6065,6066,6067,6068,6069,6070,6071,6072,6073,6074,6075,6076,6077,6078,6079,6080,6081,6082,6083,6084,6085,6086,6087,6088,6089,6090,6091,6092,6093,6094,6095,6096,6097,6098,6099,6100,6101,6102,6103,6104,6105,6106,6107,6108,6109,6110,6111,6112,6113,6114,6115,6116,6117,6118,6119,6120,6121,6122,6123,6124,6125,6126,6127,6128,6129,6130,6131,6132,6133,6134,6135,6136,6137,6138,6139,6140,6141,6142,6143,6144,6145,6146,6147,6148,6149,6150],"revision_id":2195614},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":